WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.140
The teacher asks «Qu'est-ce
que tu fais le week-end

2
00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:05.190
?» You say «Je joue au tennis».

3
00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:08.850
Then silence. Both of you just wait.

4
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.780
Next, the teacher asks just one word:

5
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.600
«Pourquoi ?» Your mind goes blank.

6
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.030
So how do you keep talking in French when

7
00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:19.900
the teacher asks a question
you didn't prepare?

8
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.230
In this mission, you'll follow
a road with three signposts,

9
00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:25.520
where a short answer keeps growing.

10
00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.930
Then you'll find out what
to say when you're stuck,

11
00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:30.230
without ever switching to English.

12
00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.480
Your mission: keep talking in French,

13
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.430
whatever the teacher throws at you.
